gaco(){return"T\xd4I \u0110I is an independent app. It is NOT an official app and does not represent the Ho Chi Minh City Public Transport Management Center, Hanoi Transport Corporation (Transerco) or any government agency."},
gTs(){return"Language / Ng\xf4n ng\u1eef"},
gacl(){return"System default"},
gach(){return"Data sources"},
gaci(){return"\u2022 HCMC bus routes, stops, schedules and fares: compiled from public information by the Ho Chi Minh City Public Transport Management Center (Go!Bus).\n\u2022 Hanoi bus routes: compiled from public information by Transerco (timbus.vn).\n\u2022 Maps, places, Hanoi metro: \xa9 OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), base map by Protomaps.\n\nSchedules are timetables (operating hours + frequency), not real-time vehicle positions. Routes, stops and fares may have changed \u2014 check official information before important trips."},
acj(a){return"Data for the current city was updated on "+a+"."},
gacq(){return"Privacy policy"},
gacp(){return'Location \u2014 used to find stops near you, as the starting point for directions, and to remind you when to get off during a trip. Only requested when you tap the button. When you tap "Start", the app keeps using your location even with the screen off until the trip ends or you tap Stop. Location is processed only on your device and is never sent anywhere.\n\nMicrophone \u2014 only turned on when you tap the \ud83c\udfa4 button to search by voice. Speech recognition is performed by your device\'s speech service (usually Google) under that provider\'s policy. T\xd4I \u0110I does not store recordings.\n\nNotifications \u2014 show trip progress (including on the lock screen) and remind you to get off.\n\nSaved places, search history \u2014 stored on your device and can be deleted at any time (Saved \u203a Delete; Recent searches \u203a Clear).\n\nTrip history \u2014 recorded when you use "Start" (origin/destination rounded to ~100 m) to power My journeys and usual-trip suggestions; all analysis runs on your device. Turn off or clear it on the My journeys page.\n\nTrip ratings \u2014 \ud83d\udc4d/\ud83d\udc4e and the tags you pick are stored with your history. If "Send anonymously" is on, the app sends route and stop codes, tags and trip time (no account, place names or coordinates) to help fix wrong data.\n\nAccount (optional) \u2014 when you sign in, saved places and trip history are synced via Supabase so you can use them on other devices. Your live location and recent searches are never uploaded. Turn off history sync or delete your account in Account & sync.\n\nData updates \u2014 each time it opens, the app downloads public data files from GitHub (github.com/mittohoa/toidi-data). GitHub receives your IP address as with any web visit; the app sends no other information.\n\nThe app has no ads, does not sell or share personal data, and uses no behavioral analytics tools.'},
